     "href": "/en/management/esg_result"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Report",
     "href": "/en/management/esg_report"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Doosan Bobcat has established a global Scope 1&2 greenhouse gas reduction target for 2030,"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "and is identifying various reduction measures and implementing a phased roadmap to achieve this goal."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Calculate Baseline Greenhouse Gas Emissions (2021)"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Establish a Global Greenhouse Gas Inventory"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Conduct Business As Usual Scenario Analysis"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "Reviewed 2030 Reduction Scenario Based on Internal and External Greenhouse Gas Reduction Capabilities"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "Set 2030 Global Scope 1&2 Greenhouse Gas Reduction Goal by 30%"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 10,
     "text": "(Baseline: 2021)"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 11,
     "text": "Doosan Bobcat practices human rights management to protect the basic rights of all employees and stakeholders."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 12,
     "text": "We are dedicated to creating a safer working environment by advancing EHS risk management."
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 13,
     "text": "EHS Risk Management"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 14,
     "text": "Workplace EHS Incident Management Process"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 15,
     "text": "Incident Intake/ Initial Reporting"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 16,
     "text": "Investigation"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 17,
     "text": "Processing/ Action"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 18,
     "text": "Final Review"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 19,
     "text": "Strengthening EHS Management"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 20,
     "text": "Identify Improvements through Risk Assessment"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 21,
     "text": "Integrate into Production Process"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 22,
     "text": "Fatality Rate for 5 Consecutive Years"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 23,
     "text": "0%"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 24,
     "text": "(2020~2024)"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 25,
     "text": "Data has been disclosed within a global reporting scope since 2020."
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 26,
     "text": "Human Rights Management"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 27,
     "text": "Doosan Bobcat respects the human rights of not only its employees but of all stakeholders engaged with its management activities, and advises third parties, including suppliers and business partners, to practice human rights management at the same level. The human rights policy of Doosan Bobcat stipulates basic human rights to be guaranteed, regardless of a person’s origin, gender, ethnicity, or other conditions. We establish and practice human rights management based on internationally-recognized principles of human rights, such as the Universal Declaration of Human Rights, the UN Guiding Principles on Business and Human Rights, the ILO Declaration on Fundamental Principles and Rights at Work and the Ten Principles of the UN Global Compact."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 28,
     "text": "Doosan Bobcat provides various channels, such as an online whistle-blowing center, for all internal and external stakeholders, including employees, suppliers, and customers, to report human rights related grievances. We operate a grievance mechanism that protects whistle blowers under confidentiality principles and handle all issues promptly and fairly."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 29,
     "text": "Guarantee of non-discrimination in hiring and freedom of association and collective bargaining"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 30,
     "text": "Prohibition of forced/child labor and human trafficking"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 31,
     "text": "Ensuring industrial safety and responsible supply chain management"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 32,
     "text": "Protection of human rights and environmental rights of local residents"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 33,
     "text": "Protection of customer human rights"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 34,
     "text": "Doosan Bobcat reviews its supplier ESG management framework"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 35,
     "text": "and systematically conducts regular ESG risk assessments to enhance supply chain ESG management."
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 36,
     "text": "Supplier ESG Management and Assessment"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 37,
     "text": "Analyze Supply Chain Risk"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 38,
     "text": "Review supply chain risks and opportunities arising from regulatory changes"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 39,
     "text": "Identify and reflect potential risks"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 40,
     "text": "Communication and Implementation of Corrective Actions"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 41,
     "text": "Share assessment results and improvement guide"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 42,
     "text": "Implementation of corrective actions for significant risks"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 43,
     "text": "Supplier Risk Assessment"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 44,
     "text": "Select suppliers for evaluation"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 45,
     "text": "Distribute assessment forms and guidance"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 46,
     "text": "Conduct regular assessments and analyze results"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 47,
     "text": "Supply Chain ESG Management Strategy",
     "href": "https://suppliers.doosanbobcat.com/"
    },
    {
