     "text": "Supplier Code of Conduct",
     "href": "https://suppliers.doosanbobcat.com/policies/code-of-conduct"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 50,
     "text": "Social Responsibility"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 51,
     "text": "2024: $11.5 million in donations"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 52,
     "text": "Doosan Bobcat is dedicated to creating a better society as a responsible member of the local community"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 53,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "/en/management/society"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 54,
     "text": "Doosan Bobcat has reinforced its ESG decision-making framework"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 55,
     "text": "by institutionalizing regular ESG reports to the Board of Directors and formalizing quarterly meetings of the ESG Committee."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 56,
     "text": "Furthermore, we enhance employee engagement and conduct annual Code of Conduct training to foster an ethical corporate culture."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 57,
     "text": "Strengthening ESG Decision-Making Framework"
    },
